  "content": "<h5 style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/889/239/01.png?width=1440&amp;height=480\" width=\"1500\" height=\"500\"></strong>&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></strong>\n</h5><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_ZHDPSgiZ5_2hFQNjPk2TQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UC_ZHDPSgiZ5_2hFQNjPk2TQ?color=red&amp;label=订阅&amp;logo=YouTube&amp;logoColor=red&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"26\"></a>\n</strong>\n<strong>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MColeccionista\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MColeccionista&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"179\" height=\"26\"></a>\n</strong>\n<strong>\n\t<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f6AuBxG3xJp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/897679645015674890?color=blueviolet&amp;label=Discord&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=blueviolet&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"179\" height=\"26\"></a>\n</strong>\n</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\">推荐使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\">JEI（Just Enough Items）</span></a> 以便于合成</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1028041/description_0416a9a7-dbea-4ad4-a818-749f29842729.png\" width=\"309\" height=\"100\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp;font-weight:bold;font-size:26px\">这是什么模组？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\"><strong>&gt; 这个模组将你喜爱的YouTube主播变成强大的Boss，你可以与他们对战。每个Boss都拥有独特而惊人的能力，灵感来源于他们的个性和内容。此外，我们还添加了多种与他们的粉丝相关的专属物品，这些物品将帮助你在战斗和冒险中取得优势。准备好挑战这些网络巨头，证明谁才是Minecraft的真正大师吧！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp;font-weight:bold;font-size:26px\">特色</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\"><strong>&gt; YouTube主播Boss：面对基于知名YouTube主播的强大Boss，每个Boss都拥有独特的技能和特殊攻击，灵感来源于他们的个性和内容。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\"><strong>&gt; 粉丝物品：发现与YouTube主播粉丝相关的特殊物品，这些物品与粉丝紧密相连。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\"><strong>&gt; 新合成配方：利用粉丝掉落的材料和其他稀有资源进行合成。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\"><strong>&gt; 结构：在花朵生物群系中探索生成在世界中的独特结构。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp;font-weight:bold;font-size:26px\">创意视频</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\"><strong>&gt; 最新版本的视频展示：</strong></span></p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/A6H18OrPay8\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp;font-weight:bold;font-size:26px\">额外地图？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"#\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/889/769/03.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"300\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\"><strong>&gt; 为了充分体验这个模组，我制作了一张自定义地图。你可以通过以下链接下载：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;amp\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fyoutubers-god-map%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube主播之神地图</a></strong></span></p>",
